## 1. Admin Section

### 1.1 Login (Admin)

### 1.1 Login (Admin)

POST http://localhost:8080/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv STRAPI_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}",
    "rememberMe": true
}

### 1.2 Register (Admin)

POST http://localhost:8080/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "{{$dotenv FIRSTNAME}}",
    "lastname": "{{$dotenv LASTNAME}}",
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv STRAPI_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

### 1.3 Forgot Password (Admin)

POST http://localhost:8080/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_EMAIL}}"
}

### 1.4 Reset Password (Admin)

POST http://localhost:8080/admin/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "resetPasswordToken": "{{$dotenv ADMIN_RESET_CODE}}",
    "password": "{{$dotenv STRAPI_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}"
}

