## 3. Content Section

## 3.1 Student

### 3.1.1 Create Student

POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

{
  "data": {
    "name": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_NAME}}",
    "mobile": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_MOBILE}}",
    "cardId": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_CARDID}}"
  }
}
### 3.1.2 List All Students

GET http://localhost:8080/api/students
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

### 3.1.3 List Student with ID

GET http://localhost:8080/api/students/{{$dotenv STUDENT_ID}}
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

### 3.1.4 Update Student

PUT http://localhost:8080/api/students/{{$dotenv STUDENT_ID}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{$dotenv USER_TOKEN}}

{
    "data": {
        "name": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_NAME_UPDATE}}",
        "mobile": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_MOBILE_UPDATE}}",
        "cardId": "{{$dotenv STUDENT_CARDID_UPDATE}}"
    }
}


